    <string name="about_title">About Persista</string>
    <string name="about_close">Got it</string>
    <string name="about_text">Persista adds a persistent alarm sound to selected notifications. For example, to calendar reminders so you don’t miss meetings.\n\nTo add an alarm:\n\n1. Tap “Add rule”.\n2. Select an app, such as “Calendar”.\n3. If needed, enter a word or phrase, such as “team meeting”. The alarm will ring if the notification contains that phrase.\n4. Choose an alarm sound.\n5. Tap “Save”.</string>
